cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol documentation, please cite it as below."
title: "Candy CSW 475D NFC protocol reference"
abstract: >-
  Reverse-engineered, on-machine-validated documentation of the NFC protocol
  (ST M24SR02-Y, NFC Forum Type 4A, NDEF external type candy.com:transp.ctrl)
  used by the Candy CSW 475D/5-S washer-dryer, including the GPO low-to-high
  handshake required to start a custom wash cycle, with Python, Android and
  iOS reference code.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "Gonvar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gonvar/candy-csw-nfc"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - NFC
  - ISO 14443
  - NDEF
  - ST M24SR
  - Candy
  - washing machine
  - washer-dryer
  - reverse engineering
  - interoperability
  - Core NFC
  - IsoDep
